<title>USA: R.R. Donnelley Q1 profit vs loss after item.</title>
<headline>R.R. Donnelley Q1 profit vs loss after item.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	 $0.20     loss	 $2.45</p>
<p> Net	 profit	29,431     loss     376,917</p>
<p> Revs		   1,475,238		1,535,412</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 145,785		  154,017</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding a $512 million pretax restructuring charge, Q1 1996 income was $34 million or $0.22 a share.</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 operating earnings were $61 million, compared with an operating loss of $450 million including the restructuring charge. Excluding the charge, Q1 1996 operating earnings were $62 million.</p>
<p>(( --Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
